# recognition-vsm-is-mirror-spec-grammar.md`). Second-witness gate
# opens on Alex + Lore paper §"VSM at compile altitude" section
# landing. Held at CANDIDATE strength.
#
# === Forward-promised — NOT landed this tick ===
#
# - TICK 2: deprecate `project` grammar + update dogfood mirror.spec
#   to use `system @mirror.spec { ... }`.
# - system_spec_witnessing composed bilateral at empirical-firing
#   altitude (Reed's pillar territory: pillar predicates for VSM
#   invariants).
# - `.system` cli-boundary wrapper at @mirror altitude for
#   introspection: `mirror system <spec>` reads the system_spec
#   carrier and emits the VSM diagnostic.

out @mirror/spec/system
out system_spec
out system
out s1
out s2
out s3
out s4
out s5
out feedback_loops
out kintsugi_tooling
out system_spec_well_formed
